{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lemonade Apocalypse 2: The Great Filter</strong> is an incremental clicker, with branching gameplay and story. Explore 27 different gameplay combinations and endings with the story based Prestige mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: We're currently redesigning the game to include <strong>Custom Recipes</strong> and <strong>50+ ingredients!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPPLY &amp; DEMAND SIM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core is the supply and demand mechanic. Use dubious means to manipulate demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/12b50134ae47e025a3283f9be3f8f3f2.avif?t=1759748835\" width=606 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/aadd6b2003245c39f6f240401f8b6017.avif?t=1759748835\" width=606 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENVY THE NEIGHBOURHOOD KIDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All your friends has a bicycle, and you want one too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/03e16aa5d43464f7efae079ec06c5f41.avif?t=1759748835\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUMBLE BEGINNINGS OF GREED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After getting a bicycle you realize that this can become a business. Choose between Cheap Lemonade, Aesthetic Lemonade and Sugarfree Lemonade. Each with its unique twist on the gameplay, and affects the story! More choices in the Factory stage and End Game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/7c26d8b1c059593aaadbf7674dee47a1.avif?t=1759748835\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/c7382d761c3aae9c983fe1959b153d39.avif?t=1759748835\" width=606 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE A FACTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the lemonade production with employees - and look out for unions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/857fd629b7c03e5c23fb831da2a22e2d.avif?t=1759748835\" width=606 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORLD DOMINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get involved in politics once you reach enough influence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NUMBERS GO UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an incremental clicker. Expect to become filthy rich, and the worlds first trillionaire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/0bd1cd21e357bd7f50c3bf4ab5079f9c.avif?t=1759748835\" data-has-big width=800 height=455 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDDRAWN ART</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art is drawn by hand with a unique style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story driven incremental clicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige when you finish the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply &amp; demand sim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that evolves with your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 different story endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple mini-games</p>